    "detailed_description": "Travel through diverse star systems, collect illegal cargo, and deliver it through dangerous zones \u2014 all while being chased by space cops. In Rogue Run, every delivery is a race against time and the law.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/dc589cf37db580c76bf827de4285084c.poster.avif?t=1753655795\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/dc589cf37db580c76bf827de4285084c.webm?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/dc589cf37db580c76bf827de4285084c.mp4?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 Deliveries Above All</h2>The goal is simple: <strong>complete at least 100 smuggling deliveries in under 15 minutes</strong>. Survive and the <strong>Operations Base will rescue you</strong> \u2014 with your loot.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/6ae2a7950fb89ec680cdf40ab99662c0.poster.avif?t=1753655795\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/6ae2a7950fb89ec680cdf40ab99662c0.webm?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/6ae2a7950fb89ec680cdf40ab99662c0.mp4?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 Tactical Combat</h2>Instead of relying solely on weapons, <strong>use the environment and enemy tactics against them</strong>. <strong>Let them destroy each other</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd27 Sideral Workshop</h2>Choose from <strong>dozens of upgrades</strong> that make each run unique. <strong>Enhance your ship</strong> via the <strong>roaming workshop of the mysterious Mr. Black</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/7f5a83f2042e025d1629723108d2b7aa.poster.avif?t=1753655795\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/7f5a83f2042e025d1629723108d2b7aa.webm?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/7f5a83f2042e025d1629723108d2b7aa.mp4?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udef8 Ship Variety</h2>Unlock and upgrade ships, each with <strong>unique stats and skills</strong> to match <strong>different playstyles</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/86c9081dc1ac8b8d446fa1db0b47d584.poster.avif?t=1753655795\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/86c9081dc1ac8b8d446fa1db0b47d584.webm?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/86c9081dc1ac8b8d446fa1db0b47d584.mp4?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Dynamic Wanted Level</h2>The more you deliver, <strong>the higher your wanted level</strong> \u2014 bringing <strong>faster, heavier, and deadlier foes</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Score &amp; Leaderboards</h2>Compete indirectly with others via <strong>arcade-style rankings</strong>. <strong>More deliveries means more bragging rights</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/fbed3b84f2c1372ae314aff53b9edd19.poster.avif?t=1753655795\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/fbed3b84f2c1372ae314aff53b9edd19.webm?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/fbed3b84f2c1372ae314aff53b9edd19.mp4?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0c Random Cosmic Events</h2><strong>Black holes, solar storms, nebulae</strong> and more appear randomly, <strong>directly impacting gameplay</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc2d The \u201cRat Trap\u201d Base</h2><strong>Expand and customize your base</strong>, unlocking <strong>global upgrades and new gear</strong> for future runs.<br><br><strong>Get ready</strong> for a <strong>space challenge</strong> where <strong>strategy, reflexes, and risk management</strong> are key to becoming the <strong>galaxy\u2019s most notorious smuggler</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/6fd944c8d49a42c3aee955dad8cafa06.poster.avif?t=1753655795\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/6fd944c8d49a42c3aee955dad8cafa06.webm?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/6fd944c8d49a42c3aee955dad8cafa06.mp4?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Travel through diverse star systems, collect illegal cargo, and deliver it through dangerous zones \u2014 all while being chased by space cops. In Rogue Run, every delivery is a race against time and the law.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/dc589cf37db580c76bf827de4285084c.poster.avif?t=1753655795\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/dc589cf37db580c76bf827de4285084c.webm?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/dc589cf37db580c76bf827de4285084c.mp4?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 Deliveries Above All</h2>The goal is simple: <strong>complete at least 100 smuggling deliveries in under 15 minutes</strong>. Survive and the <strong>Operations Base will rescue you</strong> \u2014 with your loot.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/6ae2a7950fb89ec680cdf40ab99662c0.poster.avif?t=1753655795\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/6ae2a7950fb89ec680cdf40ab99662c0.webm?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/6ae2a7950fb89ec680cdf40ab99662c0.mp4?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 Tactical Combat</h2>Instead of relying solely on weapons, <strong>use the environment and enemy tactics against them</strong>. <strong>Let them destroy each other</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd27 Sideral Workshop</h2>Choose from <strong>dozens of upgrades</strong> that make each run unique. <strong>Enhance your ship</strong> via the <strong>roaming workshop of the mysterious Mr. Black</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/7f5a83f2042e025d1629723108d2b7aa.poster.avif?t=1753655795\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/7f5a83f2042e025d1629723108d2b7aa.webm?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/7f5a83f2042e025d1629723108d2b7aa.mp4?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udef8 Ship Variety</h2>Unlock and upgrade ships, each with <strong>unique stats and skills</strong> to match <strong>different playstyles</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/86c9081dc1ac8b8d446fa1db0b47d584.poster.avif?t=1753655795\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/86c9081dc1ac8b8d446fa1db0b47d584.webm?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/86c9081dc1ac8b8d446fa1db0b47d584.mp4?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Dynamic Wanted Level</h2>The more you deliver, <strong>the higher your wanted level</strong> \u2014 bringing <strong>faster, heavier, and deadlier foes</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Score &amp; Leaderboards</h2>Compete indirectly with others via <strong>arcade-style rankings</strong>. <strong>More deliveries means more bragging rights</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/fbed3b84f2c1372ae314aff53b9edd19.poster.avif?t=1753655795\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/fbed3b84f2c1372ae314aff53b9edd19.webm?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/fbed3b84f2c1372ae314aff53b9edd19.mp4?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0c Random Cosmic Events</h2><strong>Black holes, solar storms, nebulae</strong> and more appear randomly, <strong>directly impacting gameplay</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc2d The \u201cRat Trap\u201d Base</h2><strong>Expand and customize your base</strong>, unlocking <strong>global upgrades and new gear</strong> for future runs.<br><br><strong>Get ready</strong> for a <strong>space challenge</strong> where <strong>strategy, reflexes, and risk management</strong> are key to becoming the <strong>galaxy\u2019s most notorious smuggler</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/6fd944c8d49a42c3aee955dad8cafa06.poster.avif?t=1753655795\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/6fd944c8d49a42c3aee955dad8cafa06.webm?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/6fd944c8d49a42c3aee955dad8cafa06.mp4?t=1753655795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
